{"seq":17,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:36:56.924Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"6a06938a688a15363b845b298ab8c13cfe165a9f31d601b19228fdd8f684d42c","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, from Moss's Strategic digests:\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until it changed hands on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 digest says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day.\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 12/1/2025 and 5/4/2026 digests both put it with Gideon. One oddity: the 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" of it that day, while the 2025 digests already call it Gideon's fleet account. I'd call it Gideon's either way, but check that before putting a date on the slide.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, probably. The latest digest (9/30/2026) only says \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account in the digests. It was Nadia's in March 2025, and the digests don't record a handover. Please confirm.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't tell. The digests call it the pod's \"outdoor\" or \"retail\" account and never name an owner. Nadia is hosting its gate clerk training, but that doesn't show ownership. The CRM account files aren't visible to me, so please check the CRM.\n\nVantorre Group's handover date is the only date the digests state outright.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
