{"seq":19,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-27T00:37:00.666Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"12675eb2db903e4e21d4dea5566d8d5f8432ecd85a35d724cd3909345ba2e2bc","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied in the #strategic-pod thread. Only Vantorre Group's owner and handover date are firmly established.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until it changed hands on 2026-05-04. Moss's 5/3 digest says \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment that day.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. One caveat: the 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" that day, but 2025 digests already call it his fleet account. I flagged that for Ruth to check before she dates it on the slide.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Probably Gideon. The 9/30 digest only says \"Gideon's medical account\", and Orlavine is the only medical account in the digests. I asked Ruth to confirm.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't tell. The digests never name an owner. I asked Ruth to check the CRM, because the account files aren't visible to me."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
